cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ZORG Animation Engine in research,
  education, creative computing, or software
  development, please cite this repository.
type: software
title: "ZORG Animation Engine"
abstract: >-
  ZORG Animation Engine is an open-source mathematical
  animation research project exploring procedural
  geometry, deterministic motion, shape transformation,
  and reproducible visual simulation. The engine
  investigates mathematical approaches to expressive
  animation through governed numerical dynamics,
  transparent experimentation, and independent
  verification.
authors:
  - family-names: Feeney
    given-names: Don Michael
    name-suffix: Jr.
keywords:
